# The agent's secret key, from step 02 of the user tab. Shown once and never stored by us.
#
# This key is nearly powerless by design: the account it belongs to has no USDC trustline, so it
# cannot hold the asset it spends. Its only route to money is asking the allowance contract, and
# the contract refuses anything outside the rules. That is why it is safe to keep in a file like
# this on testnet — it is not a wallet.
AGENT_SECRET=
